        "text": "theorem profile_smooth {R : ℝ} (hR : 0 < R) {U : Set ℂ} (hU : IsOpen U)\n    (F : AxisFunction R U) :\n    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (profile F)\n      (Ico (0 : ℝ) (R ^ 2) ×ˢ PositiveAxisExistence.realParameterDomain U)"
